    "detailed_description": "&quot;NIGHTMARE BREAK&quot; is a single-player 3D action adventure game that pursues the &quot;fun of swordplay action.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlthough it consists of only one bleak stage, there are enemies to defeat and fragmented stories to discover.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou control a knight wielding a great sword and aim to escape from the nightmare world by clearing the stage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are no growth elements such as equipment or builds, but you can become stronger by picking up items scattered along the way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlthough strong enemies await, there are also checkpoints, so you can enjoy the game with peace of mind.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Nightmare Lore<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo one knows the lore.<br />\r\nThe Challenger got two choices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKill the Nightmare Lord<br />\r\nand will be the Lord myself.<br />\r\nOr must break this nightmare.",
